note Zero window with data in flight (review finding 14): the peer acknowledges part
note of the flight and closes its window. Every timeout sends a one-octet probe at
note SND.UNA, backed off to 60 s, leaving ssthresh and cwnd alone; the peer's ACKs keep
note the block alive past the retry limit and are not duplicate ACKs. When the window
note opens, sending resumes from SND.UNA.
