note An ARP request from the peer, sent to the Ethernet broadcast address.
fn carpreq to ulong
cmacs
for i ulong 6
put Trx i 255
end
cw16 12 2054
cw16 14 1
cw16 16 2048
put Trx 18 6
put Trx 19 4
cw16 20 1
for i ulong 6
put Trx add 22 i get Trx add 6 i
put Trx add 32 i 0
end
cw32 28 cPIP
cw32 38 cMIP
ret 42
end
